{"t":"Grimlund","s":"grimlund-c8eb0","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Map_grimlund_de414f.jpg","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p><i>This page describes the geographical location, if you were looking for the Hunting Place, see <a href=\"#/wiki/Inukaya\">Inukaya</a>.</i>\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Grimlund</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"map\">\n<img alt=\"Map grimlund\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"174\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Map_grimlund_de414f.jpg\" width=\"240\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sinatuki\">Sinatuki</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"near\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearby places</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Nibelor\">Nibelor</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Inukaya\">Inukaya</a></li></ul></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><center><b>None</b></center></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.00<br/>June 26, 2007<br/>Summer Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Grimlund</b> is a small island to the east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Nibelor\">Nibelor</a>. It is the host island for the unusual tribe of the cute-yet-dangerous chakoyas who have built the <a href=\"#/wiki/Inukaya\">Inukaya</a> village. The island is seemingly small from the base floor, but it is extensively lengthy underneath with the tunnels and passageways that were made by the chakoyas.\n</p>\n<div style=\"padding-top:1px;overflow:auto\">&lt;spoiler&gt;Place of the <a href=\"#/quest/inukaya-quest\">Inukaya Quest</a>.&lt;/spoiler&gt;</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Grimlund NPCs (1 NPC)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sinatuki\">Sinatuki</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sinatuki\"><img alt=\"Sinatuki\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sinatuki_8fcb8e.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Unknown Occupation</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">South-eastern <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Grimlund</strong></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p></div>","quests":[]}